2035:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @rmtoll CR1          DIR           LL_TIM_GetCounterMode\n
2036:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   *         CR1          CMS           LL_TIM_GetCounterMode
2037:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_tim.h ****   * @param  TIMx Timer instance
