 383:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Structure definition of some features of ADC common parameters
 384:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         and multimode
 385:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (all ADC instances belonging to the same ADC common instance).
 386:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The setting of these parameters by function @ref LL_ADC_CommonInit()
 387:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         is conditioned to ADC instances state (all ADC instances
 388:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         sharing the same ADC common instance):
