1748:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to determine whether the internal channel
1749:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         selected is available on the ADC instance selected.
1750:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The channel parameter must be a value defined from parameter
1751:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         definition of a ADC internal channel (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT,
1752:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR, ...),
1753:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         must not be a value defined from parameter definition of
1754:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC external channel (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...)
1755:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         or a value from functions where a channel number is
1756:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         returned from ADC registers,
1757:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         because internal and external channels share the same channel
1758:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         number in ADC registers. The differentiation is made only with
1759:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         parameters definitions of driver.
1760:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  __ADC_INSTANCE__ ADC instance
1761:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  __CHANNEL__ This parameter can be one of the following values:
1762:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT
