1816:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         define a single channel to monitor with analog watchdog
1817:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         from sequencer channel and groups definition.
1818:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   To be used with function @ref LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels().
