3754:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h **** /**
3755:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC group regular sequence: channel on the selected
3756:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         scan sequence rank.
3757:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this SR5E1 series, ADC group regular sequencer is
3758:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         fully configurable: sequencer length and each rank
3759:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         affectation to a channel are configurable.
3760:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to description of function @ref LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerLength().
3761:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Depending on devices and packages, some channels may not be available.
3762:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet for channels availability.
3763:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Usage of the returned channel number:
3764:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To reinject this channel into another function LL_ADC_xxx:
3765:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           the returned channel number is only partly formatted on definition
3766:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x. Therefore, it has to be compared
3767:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           with parts of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x or using
3768:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
3769:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           Then the selected literal LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x can be used
3770:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           as parameter for another function.
3771:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To get the channel number in decimal format:
3772:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           process the returned value with the helper macro
3773:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *           @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
3774:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll SQR1     SQ1            LL_ADC_REG_GetSequencerRanks\n
3775:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         SQR1     SQ2            LL_ADC_REG_GetSequencerRanks\n
