4865:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         (3) On SR5E1, fast channel allows: 2.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 15 ADC clock cy
