4903:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 10.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 10 bits
4904:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 8.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 8 bits
4905:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 6.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 6 bits
