6640:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   For devices with feature oversampling: Oversampling
6641:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         can increase data width, function for extended range
6642:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         may be needed: @ref LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData32.
6643:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll JDR1     JDATA          LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData12\n
6644:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         JDR2     JDATA          LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData12\n
6645:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         JDR3     JDATA          LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData12\n
6646:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         JDR4     JDATA          LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData12
6647:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
