6722:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         can increase data width, function for extended range
6723:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   *         may be needed: @ref LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData32.
6724:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll JDR1     JDATA          LL_ADC_INJ_ReadConversionData6\n
