1711:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @param  USARTx USART Instance
1712:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   * @param  HardwareFlowControl This parameter can be one of the following values:
1713:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_USART_HWCONTROL_NONE
1714:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/include/LL_Library/sr5e1_ll_usart.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_USART_HWCONTROL_RTS
